{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"615","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Running Track"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A boy named Ayrat lives on planet AMI-1511. Each inhabitant of this planet has a talent. Specifically, Ayrat loves running, moreover, just running is not enough for him. He is dreaming of making running a real art."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"First, he wants to construct the running track with coating "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":". On planet AMI-1511 the coating of the track is the sequence of colored blocks, where each block is denoted as the small English letter. Therefore, every coating can be treated as a string."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Unfortunately, blocks aren't freely sold to non-business customers, but Ayrat found an infinite number of coatings "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":". Also, he has scissors and glue. Ayrat is going to buy some coatings "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":", then cut out from each of them "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly one continuous piece"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (substring) and glue it to the end of his track coating. Moreover, he may choose to flip this block before glueing it. Ayrat want's to know the minimum number of coating "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" he needs to buy in order to get the coating "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" for his running track. Of course, he also want's to know some way to achieve the answer."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"First line of the input contains the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the coating that is present in the shop. Second line contains the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the coating Ayrat wants to obtain. Both strings are non-empty, consist of only small English letters and their length doesn't exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2100"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line should contain the minimum needed number of coatings "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it's impossible to create the desired coating."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the answer is not "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", then the following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines should contain two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" — numbers of ending blocks in the corresponding piece. If "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi ≤ yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" then this piece is used in the regular order, and if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi > yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" piece is used in the reversed order. Print the pieces in the order they should be glued to get the string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"abc\ncbaabc\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n3 1\n1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"aaabrytaaa\nayrat\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n1 1\n6 5\n8 7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"ami\nno\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cbaabc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" = \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" + \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ayrat"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" = \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" + \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yr"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" + \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"615C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/615/problem/C"}